DESCRIPTION >
    Replace-mode physical boundary for the 90-day repeatable Purchase conversion
    payload used by reverse-ETL consumers.

SCHEMA >
    `payment_source` String `json:$.payment_source`,
    `payment_id` String `json:$.payment_id`,
    `profile_id` Nullable(String) `json:$.profile_id`,
